sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Person
    participant F as MyFamily
    participant B as Browsy
    participant R as Peer
    participant W as Wizy
    participant N as Nety
    P->>F: reflect on a person
    F-->>B: save record class L
    B->>B: sign grant · paths · expiry
    R->>B: pull allowed deltas
    B-->>R: encrypted projection
    R->>R: verify + decrypt
    R->>W: merge with their P/L
    W-->>R: local recommendation D0/D1
    Note over W: explanation · local only
    alt owner publishes S
        B->>N: public card · consent
        N-->>R: S reads
    else no consent
        B-->>R: only L cached
    end
    P->>B: revoke / shorten expiry
    B-->>R: version++ next pull
    Note over R: copies remain · forward-only
